  "name": "M2AD",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tVisual Anomaly Detection under Complex View-Illumination Interplay: A Large-Scale Benchmark\n\t\n\n\ud83c\udf10 Hugging Face Dataset  \n\n\ud83d\udcda Paper \u2022 \ud83c\udfe0 Homepageby Yunkang Cao*, Yuqi Cheng*, Xiaohao Xu, Yiheng Zhang, Yihan Sun, Yuxiang Tan, Yuxin Zhang, Weiming Shen,  \n\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\ud83d\ude80 Updates\n\t\n\nWe're committed to open science! Here's our progress:  \n\n2025/05/19: \ud83d\udcc4 Paper released on ArXiv.  \n2025/05/16: \ud83c\udf10 Dataset homepage launched.  \n2025/05/24: \ud83e\uddea Code release for benchmark evaluation!  code\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/ChengYuQi99/M2AD.",
